-6","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-14T15:18:43Z","updated_at":"2025-02-14T15:19:31Z","body":"I fixed the issue by reusing the `_get_content_rect` instead of trying to recalculate the correct scrollbar size.\r\n\r\nBut, I found out an other issue that the last button is considered hovered and is clicable from the margin around the scrollbar:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/382ccb36-605d-40a5-b836-2a46f211180e\r\n\r\n\r\nI tested in Godot 4.3 stable and turns out that this behaviour existed in the version (minus the hover which did not exist in 4.3):\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e9a76b9f-ea9a-4ee6-8d93-ef8505dff49f\r\n\r\n\r\nI fixed it anyway by adding a check for the position vs the content area (`x_limit`) in `_find_button_at_pos` and `propagate_mouse_event`.\r\n\r\nNow:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eff5a1cd-9720-4ec2-9c55-71dba90e18c8\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659602362/reactions","t