engine/godot/pull/102842#issuecomment-2661126315","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102842","id":2661126315,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6enZCr","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-15T22:16:10Z","updated_at":"2025-02-15T22:16:10Z","body":"Indeed, there's was still some difference between `propagate_mouse_event` and `_find_button_at_pos` when the button were under the scrollbar or when the tree was scrolled to the right.\r\n\r\nTo prevent any difference between the two, I moved the commun parts in a new method called `_find_column_and_button_at_pos`. This method returns a new struct `FindColumnButtonResult` which contains all the info needed in `propagate_mouse_event` to work as before.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2661126315/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/co